OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Flargely dry with some clear spells,
OL,7,Fallowing frost to form overnight.
OL,8,FThere is a chance of the odd shower
OL,9,Ffor eastern areas, especially East
OL,10,FLothian and Berwickshire.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FAfter a cold and frosty start,
OL,13,Fit will be a mainly dry day with
OL,14,Flargely clear skies and plenty of
OL,15,Fsunshine. A few showers possible in
OL,16,FBerwickshire in the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
